# Converted .mat -> text (Python repr of stored doubles). The comparison script labBM_04_SW.m is the NTHMP benchmark script ('Solitary Wave on a Simple Beach', 'CASE     H = 0.30').
# Content: LABORATORY free-surface profile for H/d = 0.30 at nondimensional time t* = 15 (script label 'text(...,'t=15')', t* = t*sqrt(g/d) per NTHMP convention, not stated in script).
